f the age when she's noticing boys and this shy young lady has noticed the handsome Kazuya Takahashi – even if he hasn't noticed her.\n\nThis is Miu's story. The story of a young girl who is on a journey to discover the melody within her own heart and the courage to express it.\n\n(Source: RightStuf)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classical Music","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Teacher","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Athletics","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Piano: The Melody of a Young Girl's Heart","english":"Piano: The Melody of a Young Girl's Heart","native":"PIANO","romaji":"PIANO","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"钢琴恋曲"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"钢琴"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"钢琴物语"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}